{"id":"94da30522fe93e7f","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-splitting-procedure.md","title":"无 oracle 的 e-分裂自动机","display":"df-splitting-procedure — 无 oracle 的 e-分裂自动机","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-splitting-procedure","aliases":["20-df-splitting-procedure"],"display":"df-splitting-procedure — 无 oracle 的 e-分裂自动机","chapter":"12","section":"12.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Definition 12.3.1；Remark 12.3.2（阶段搜索展开）","source_printed_pages":[200],"source_pdf_pages":[230],"depends_on":["[[20-df-e-colored-node]]","[[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]","[[20-df-stages]]","[[20-thm-smn]]","[[20-df-function-tree]]","[[20-df-pairing]]","[[20-df-e-splitting]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-splitting-procedure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-splitting-procedure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-splitting-procedure — 无 oracle 的 e-分裂自动机"},{"key":"chapter","html":"12"},{"key":"section","html":"12.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 12.3.1；Remark 12.3.2（阶段搜索展开）"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>200</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>230</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f2458da73bd8fe19\" href=\"?note=f2458da73bd8fe19\" title=\"20-df-e-colored-node\">20-df-e-colored-node</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"01d522a0b0df3738\" href=\"?note=01d522a0b0df3738\" title=\"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation\">20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a4daa2d7bdea73d3\" href=\"?note=a4daa2d7bdea73d3\" title=\"20-df-function-tree\">20-df-function-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5c8fcd5a2bc3a582\" href=\"?note=5c8fcd5a2bc3a582\" title=\"20-df-e-splitting\">20-df-e-splitting</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定原环境参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,e\\in\\omega\">\\(j,e\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=T_j\">\\(T=T_j\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FTree}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{FTree}(T)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{ran}(T)\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{ran}(T)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu,\\rho,\\tau,\\alpha,\\eta\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\nu,\\rho,\\tau,\\alpha,\\eta\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,n\\in\\omega\">\\(s,n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sp}(T,\\sigma,e)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sp}(T,\\sigma,e)\\)</span> 在这个固定 j 的环境中解释；不把相同外延 T 的不同索引当作同一个阶段搜索参数。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_{j,s}\">\\(T_{j,s}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_{e,s}^\\rho\">\\(\\Phi_{e,s}^\\rho\\)</span> 使用原阶段模拟。串对投影与数值配对的投影按输入类型区分。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a4daa2d7bdea73d3\" href=\"?note=a4daa2d7bdea73d3\" title=\"20-df-function-tree\">20-df-function-tree</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"5c8fcd5a2bc3a582\" href=\"?note=5c8fcd5a2bc3a582\" title=\"20-df-e-splitting\">20-df-e-splitting</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"f2458da73bd8fe19\" href=\"?note=f2458da73bd8fe19\" title=\"20-df-e-colored-node\">20-df-e-colored-node</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"01d522a0b0df3738\" href=\"?note=01d522a0b0df3738\" title=\"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation\">20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}splitting\\text{-}procedure}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nR_{j,e}(\\nu,s,\\rho,\\tau)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\nu\\prec\\rho\\land\\nu\\prec\\tau\\land\\operatorname{code}(\\rho)&lt;s\\land\\operatorname{code}(\\tau)&lt;s\\\\\n\\land\\exists\\beta,\\gamma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\\n[\\operatorname{code}(\\beta)&lt;s\\land\\operatorname{code}(\\gamma)&lt;s\n\\land T_{j,s}(\\beta)\\downarrow=\\rho\\land T_{j,s}(\\gamma)\\downarrow=\\tau]\\\\\n\\land\\exists x,y,z&lt;s\\ [\\Phi_{e,s}^\\rho(x)\\downarrow=y\\land\\Phi_{e,s}^\\tau(x)\\downarrow=z\\land y\\ne z],\\\\\nE_{j,e}(\\nu,s):=\\{\\langle\\operatorname{code}(\\rho),\\operatorname{code}(\\tau)\\rangle:\n\\rho,\\tau\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\land R_{j,e}(\\nu,s,\\rho,\\tau)\\},\\\\\nt_{j,e}(\\nu)\\downarrow=s\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\nE_{j,e}(\\nu,s)\\ne\\varnothing\\land\\forall v&lt;s\\ [E_{j,e}(\\nu,v)=\\varnothing],\\\\\nq_{j,e}(\\nu)\\downarrow=(\\rho,\\tau)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists s\\in\\omega\\ [t_{j,e}(\\nu)\\downarrow=s\n\\land\\langle\\operatorname{code}(\\rho),\\operatorname{code}(\\tau)\\rangle\\in E_{j,e}(\\nu,s)\\\\\n\\land\\forall m\\in E_{j,e}(\\nu,s)\\\n(\\langle\\operatorname{code}(\\rho),\\operatorname{code}(\\tau)\\rangle\\le m)],\\\\\n\\mathscr S_0:=\\{(\\varnothing,\\sigma)\\},\\\\\n\\mathscr S_{n+1}:=\\mathscr S_n\\cup\n\\{(\\alpha^\\frown i,\\eta):\\alpha,\\eta\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\land i\\in2\\land\n\\exists\\nu,\\rho,\\tau\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\\n[(\\alpha,\\nu)\\in\\mathscr S_n\\land q_{j,e}(\\nu)\\downarrow=(\\rho,\\tau)\\\\\n\\land((i=0\\land\\eta=\\rho)\\lor(i=1\\land\\eta=\\tau))]\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sp}(T,\\sigma,e):=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\mathscr S_n,\\qquad\nS:=\\operatorname{Sp}(T,\\sigma,e),\\\\\nS(\\varnothing)\\downarrow=\\sigma,\\\\\nS(\\alpha^\\frown i)\\downarrow=\\eta\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\nu,\\rho,\\tau\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\\n[S(\\alpha)\\downarrow=\\nu\\land q_{j,e}(\\nu)\\downarrow=(\\rho,\\tau)\n\\land((i=0\\land\\eta=\\rho)\\lor(i=1\\land\\eta=\\tau))]\\quad(i\\in2),\\\\\n\\pi_0((\\rho,\\tau)):=\\rho,\\qquad\\pi_1((\\rho,\\tau)):=\\tau.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}splitting\\text{-}procedure}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nR_{j,e}(\\nu,s,\\rho,\\tau)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\nu\\prec\\rho\\land\\nu\\prec\\tau\\land\\operatorname{code}(\\rho)&lt;s\\land\\operatorname{code}(\\tau)&lt;s\\\\\n\\land\\exists\\beta,\\gamma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\\n[\\operatorname{code}(\\beta)&lt;s\\land\\operatorname{code}(\\gamma)&lt;s\n\\land T_{j,s}(\\beta)\\downarrow=\\rho\\land T_{j,s}(\\gamma)\\downarrow=\\tau]\\\\\n\\land\\exists x,y,z&lt;s\\ [\\Phi_{e,s}^\\rho(x)\\downarrow=y\\land\\Phi_{e,s}^\\tau(x)\\downarrow=z\\land y\\ne z],\\\\\nE_{j,e}(\\nu,s):=\\{\\langle\\operatorname{code}(\\rho),\\operatorname{code}(\\tau)\\rangle:\n\\rho,\\tau\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\land R_{j,e}(\\nu,s,\\rho,\\tau)\\},\\\\\nt_{j,e}(\\nu)\\downarrow=s\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\nE_{j,e}(\\nu,s)\\ne\\varnothing\\land\\forall v&lt;s\\ [E_{j,e}(\\nu,v)=\\varnothing],\\\\\nq_{j,e}(\\nu)\\downarrow=(\\rho,\\tau)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists s\\in\\omega\\ [t_{j,e}(\\nu)\\downarrow=s\n\\land\\langle\\operatorname{code}(\\rho),\\operatorname{code}(\\tau)\\rangle\\in E_{j,e}(\\nu,s)\\\\\n\\land\\forall m\\in E_{j,e}(\\nu,s)\\\n(\\langle\\operatorname{code}(\\rho),\\operatorname{code}(\\tau)\\rangle\\le m)],\\\\\n\\mathscr S_0:=\\{(\\varnothing,\\sigma)\\},\\\\\n\\mathscr S_{n+1}:=\\mathscr S_n\\cup\n\\{(\\alpha^\\frown i,\\eta):\\alpha,\\eta\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\land i\\in2\\land\n\\exists\\nu,\\rho,\\tau\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\\n[(\\alpha,\\nu)\\in\\mathscr S_n\\land q_{j,e}(\\nu)\\downarrow=(\\rho,\\tau)\\\\\n\\land((i=0\\land\\eta=\\rho)\\lor(i=1\\land\\eta=\\tau))]\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sp}(T,\\sigma,e):=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\mathscr S_n,\\qquad\nS:=\\operatorname{Sp}(T,\\sigma,e),\\\\\nS(\\varnothing)\\downarrow=\\sigma,\\\\\nS(\\alpha^\\frown i)\\downarrow=\\eta\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\nu,\\rho,\\tau\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\\n[S(\\alpha)\\downarrow=\\nu\\land q_{j,e}(\\nu)\\downarrow=(\\rho,\\tau)\n\\land((i=0\\land\\eta=\\rho)\\lor(i=1\\land\\eta=\\tau))]\\quad(i\\in2),\\\\\n\\pi_0((\\rho,\\tau)):=\\rho,\\qquad\\pi_1((\\rho,\\tau)):=\\tau.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>搜索仍先选最早见证阶段，再选该阶段最小的数值配对代码；没有改成对所有未来见证取最小值。最小值条件现用成员性与全称下界写出，空见证集不会触发未定义的 min 项。</p>\n<p>树图通过自然数阶段的集合递归给出，其并集与原按域串长度的递归一致；找不到分裂时相应子节点仍不定义。j 仍是明确声明的环境参数，没有悄悄给同一外延树选择一个新规范索引。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 12.3.1；Remark 12.3.2（阶段搜索展开）；印刷页 200；PDF 第 230 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","t